[en.IDEA_ALL_CANNOT_CALL_ALLIES_OR_JOIN_WARS]
Mind Own Business

[en.IDEA_ALL_CANNOT_CALL_ALLIES_OR_JOIN_WARS_desc]
No matter it’s because of domestic public opinion, international politics, or economic conditions, treaty restrictions, or even communication or military capability limitations, we cannot join the wars of allies or call allies to join wars.

